abstract: "A conceptual AI Foundations repository defining the specific point of possibility of consciousness and point of mattering as a proposed coordinate: the particular possibility at which consciousness can become actual and consequence can begin. The repository distinguishes this core conceptual claim from unresolved hypotheses about persistence, transfer, recurrence, reset, binding, and any consciousness signal independent of a receiver."

